  "notes": "Image 'ESP32 SIM Card SIM800L T-Call&PMU' shows the T-Call board with AXP192. The grey 'Name' boxes are board names; pink GPIO boxes used as labels. Silkscreen spellings (VP, VN, TX, RX, 5V-IN) put first in functions. Not transcribed: SIM800L-to-ESP32 table (TX 26, RX 27, PWKEY 4, RST 5, POWER 23) and AXP192 table (SDA 21, SCL 22, IRQ 35, DTR 32, RI 33, LED 13), which are internal connections, not wiring points."
